WEBVTT

00:00:00.662 --> 00:00:04.429
To evaluate hallucination
risk before generation, we test candidate

00:00:04.429 --> 00:00:07.536
camera moves against a lightweight
3D proxy of the take.

00:00:07.536 --> 00:00:11.502
Dragging the compromise slider lets
filmmakers smoothly explore intermediate

00:00:11.502 --> 00:00:15.567
paths between what was shot
and what was planned
Under the coverage

00:00:15.567 --> 00:00:19.797
overlay, missing background surfaces
light up in red as the camera shifts.

00:00:19.797 --> 00:00:24.126
The resolution overlay flags
missing detail when pushing in, warning

00:00:24.126 --> 00:00:27.101
where a close-up demands data
the sensor never captured

00:00:27.464 --> 00:00:30.207
And the performance
overlay tracks dynamic subjects,

00:00:30.207 --> 00:00:33.710
highlighting unseen angles
in yellow when orbiting the actor
